
@startuml title
title Sleep Health Research - UML Component Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Research Analyst" as Analyst

component Streamlit
component "LangGraph router" as Router
component "Research worker" as Research
component "Reflective worker" as Reflect
component "LangChain RAG tool" as RAG
database ChromaDB

' Added component
component "Scope Reply" as Scope

' Original connections with data labels
Analyst --> Streamlit : Health inquiry
Streamlit ..> Router : Question
Router ..> Research : Supported question
Router ..> Reflect : Draft + evidence
Research ..> RAG : Search query
RAG ..> ChromaDB : Vector search

' Additional connections
Router ..> Scope : Out-of-scope question
Scope --> Streamlit : Scope message
ChromaDB --> RAG : Relevant passages
RAG --> Research : Evidence + source IDs
Research --> Router : Evidence + draft
Reflect --> Router : Verdict + answer
Router --> Streamlit : Final response

' Added UML interfaces
interface "IWorkflow" as IW
interface "IResearch" as IR
interface "IReflection" as IF
interface "IRetrieval" as IRT
interface "IVectorSearch" as IV

Router - IW
Research - IR
Reflect - IF
RAG - IRT
ChromaDB - IV

' Component responsibilities
note right of Router
  Planner / Router
  Function: select()
  Classifies and routes questions.
end note

note right of Research
  Research Worker
  Function: research()
  Retrieves evidence and
  creates an extractive draft.
end note

note right of Reflect
  Reflective Worker
  Function: reflect()
  Checks evidence grounding
  and returns a verdict.
end note

note bottom of ChromaDB
  Collection: cdc_sleep_v1
  Four curated CDC passages
  Binary keyword vectors
  In-memory storage
end note

@enduml
